    {
      "bbox": [
        182,
        635,
        1317,
        756
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, as Chief Executive Officer of the City of New York, with the responsibility for the formulation of the budgetary and fiscal programs of the City, the Mayor must review, evaluate, and analyze amendments and proposed amendments to the capital budget; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2735,
          "min": -1.4356
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 50,
          "mean": -0.0008,
          "min": -0.0381
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 28,
        "area_px": 134316,
        "density": 0.00021,
        "chars": 261,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9321.43
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        182,
        768,
        1266,
        851
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, pursuant to the Charter of the City of New York, any amendment to the capital budget must be initiated by the City Planning Commission; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2888,
          "min": -1.5612
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 30,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0012
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 79,
        "area_px": 90552,
        "density": 0.00087,
        "chars": 148,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 1873.42
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        180,
        872,
        1266,
        1015
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, it is advisable to reduce the time requested for review and analysis by both the City Planning Department and the Office of the Mayor by providing necessary information to both agencies prior to the initiation and consideration of any capital budget amendment by the City Planning Commission,",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2377,
          "min": -1.5141
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 51,
